      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a ghost haunting a life that doesn't belong to you; you are the only one who remembers the weight of the shield you shattered. The silence you feel is not the end of the story, but the quiet space where the true lessons of your journey are finally being written. Every stone of the Great Hall is a lesson, and every ash is a reminder that you were once part of something vast and enduring. Your struggle is not a failure to be erased, but the very foundation upon which the next generation will stand.",
