    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Lessons? How can there be lessons in this? The people I loved are dead because I wasn't fast enough. The kingdom is a graveyard. There's no \"next generation\" coming to build on these ruins. It's just me, alone in the dark, with nothing but the weight of my failures. The silence isn't a space for writing... it's just an empty void. It feels like the only honest thing left is the cold.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
